  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tadamon Accelerator for Food Security Response Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tadamon Accelerator for Food Security is part of the IsDB-ISFD NGO Empowerment for Poverty Reduction Program is a thematic initiative that provides both capacity building and grants to civil society organizations (CSOs). The accelerator focuses on two key areas to address food security challenges in OIC Member countries: Climate Smart Agriculture and New Technologies for Food Access and Utilization.</narrative>
  </description>
